{
  "title": "Salawat upon Imam Zayn al-Abidin (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى عَلِيِّ بْنِ الْحُسَيْنِ سَيِّدِ الْعَابِدِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA A'LIYYIBNIL HUSAYNI SAYYIDIL A'ABIDEEN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Ali the son of al-Husayn, the chief of worshippers,\nالَّذِي اسْتَخْلَصْتَهٗ لِنَفْسِكَ\nALLADHIS TAKHLASTAHOO LINAFSIK\nwhom You have purely dedicated to Yourself,\nوَجَعَلْتَ مِنْهُ اَئِمَّةَ الْهُدٰى\nWA JA'ALTA MINHU A'IMMATAL HUDAA\nand from whom You brought forth the Leaders of True Guidance\nالَّذِيْنَ يَهْدُوْنَ بِالْحَقِّ وَبِهٖ يَعْدِلُوْنَ\nALLADHEENA YAHDOONA BIL HAQQI WA BIHEE YA'DILOON\nwho guide to the truth and judge with it.\nاخْتَرْتَهٗ لِنَفْسِكَ\nIKHTARTAHOO LINAFSIK\nYou have chosen him for Yourself,\nوَطَهَّرْتَهٗ مِنَ الرِّجْسِ\nWA TAHHARTAHOO MINAR RIJS\npurified him against filth,\nوَاصْطَفَيْتَهٗ وَجَعَلْتَهٗ هَادِيًا مَهْدِيًّا\nWASTAFAYTAHOO WA JA'ALTAHOO HAADIYAN MAHDIYYAA\nselected him, and made him guide and well-guided.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَصَلِّ عَلَيْهِ\nALLAAHUMMA FASALLI A'LAYH\nO Allah, send blessings upon him\nاَفْضَلَ مَا صَلَّيْتَ عَلٰىۤ اَحَدٍ مِّنْ ذُرِّيَّةِ اَنْبِيَاۤئِكَ\nAFDALA MAA SALLAYTA A'LAA AHADIM MIN DHURRIYYATI ANBIYAA'IK\nwith the most excellent blessings that You have ever sent upon any of Your Prophets' offspring\nحَتّٰى يَبْلُغَ بِهٖ مَا تَقَرُّ بِهٖ عَيْنُهٗ فِي الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ\nHATTAA YABLUGHA BIHEE MAA TAQARRU BIHEE A'YNUHOO FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRAH\nso that these blessings raise him to what delights his eye in this world and the Hereafter.\nاِنَّكَ عَزِيْزٌ حَكِيْمٌ\nINNAKA A'ZEEZUN HAKEEM\nYou are verily Almighty and Wise.",
  "merits": "Among the recommended rites of Fridays, Shaykh al-Tusi, in Misbah al-Mutahajjid, records an invocation of blessings upon the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.), Lady Fatimah (s.a.) and each of the Imams (a.s.) in turn, reported from Imam al-Hasan al-'Askari (a.s.). This is its part upon Imam Zayn al-Abidin (a.s.)."
}
